    "en": {
      "trackName": "Retrogram",
      "description": "Think you’re a word nerd? Put your vocabulary to the test with new word puzzles every day\n\nRetrogram is a love letter to the 1970s — a cozy collection of handcrafted word games, curious words and satisfying puzzles to make part of your daily routine\n\nPLAY EVERY DAY\n\nSPELLOTRON\nMake as many words as you can using seven letters. Find the pangram, climb the ranks and discover interesting stories behind some of your favorite words\n\nWORDWAY\nBuild a bridge of words from one word to another. Use the letters you’re given and find a path across the board\n\nTHERE’S MORE\nSubscribe to Retrogram to catch up on the past week of daily puzzles, explore the Puzzle Vault, play limited-edition bonus packs, switch things up with vintage app icons, and play after dark with Neon Nites\n\nFEATURES\n\n* Two handcrafted word puzzles every day\n* Play today’s Spellotron and Wordway puzzles for free\n* Catch up on the past seven days\n* A growing Vault of bonus puzzles\n* Limited-edition puzzle packs\n* Neon Nites dark theme\n* Vintage alternate app icons\n* SharePlay — solve together over FaceTime\n* Play Spellotron on your Apple Watch\n* No ads, ever\n\nAdditional details\n\nPrivacy policy: https://retrogram.app/#privacy\nTerms of use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
